        <li><strong>HKT 18:00 (6:00 PM)</strong> → EST 05:00 AM → <strong>Same calendar day</strong></li>
        <li><strong>HKT 22:00 (10:00 PM)</strong> → EST 09:00 AM → <strong>Same calendar day</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p>
